{
  "description": "The 'Surprise me' question catalogue for the Ask (NL->FHIR) explorer. Every expanded variant is pre-built into the LLM cache (scripts/build-ask-cache.mjs) so a random question always replays a REAL Grok translation key-free, while the generated SQL executes live. The expansion logic lives in frontend/shared/lib/ask-questions.mjs and is shared verbatim by the UI and the cache builder - the strings must match byte for byte.",
